* If no precheck is performed, this parameter is not returned.', example='true'),
  dryRunResult?: boolean(name='DryRunResult', description='Indicates whether the precheck for creating the instance is successful. Valid values:
* **true**: Passed.
* **false**: Failed.

> * If no precheck is performed, this parameter is not returned.
> * If the precheck fails, the corresponding error is returned.', example='true'),
  message?: string(name='Message', description='The prompt message for the batch creation task.

> This parameter is returned only when the **Amount** parameter is greater than 1.', example='Batch Create DBInstance Task Is In Process.'),
  orderId?: string(name='OrderId', description='The order ID.', example='1007893702****'),
  port?: string(name='Port', description='The port number corresponding to the internal endpoint of the instance.', example='3306'),
  requestId?: string(name='RequestId', description='The request ID.', example='1E43AAE0-BEE8-43DA-860D-EAF2AA0724DC'),
  tagResult?: boolean(name='TagResult', description='Indicates whether the instance is successfully tagged. Valid values:
* **true**: Succeeded.
* **false**: Failed.

> If no tag is bound to the instance, this parameter is not returned.', example='true'),
  taskId?: string(name='TaskId', description='The task ID of the batch creation task.

* This parameter is returned only when the **Amount** parameter is greater than 1.
* Currently, you cannot view the task by using the value of **TaskId**.', example='s2365879-a9d0-55af-fgae-f2****'),
}

